--- !u!114 &912
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_PrefabParentObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInternal: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 259}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 9256cacf08420408287f2429960aca93, type: 1}
  m_Name:
  categories:
  - Weapons
  - Mines & Items
  - Bodykits
  - Armor
  - Vehicles
  cat1:
  - Rocket Launcher|Long and medium range self-propelled anti-vehicle warheads that deliver explosive damage.|6|4|0|3|0|3
  - Plasma Blaster|High energy beams of plasma delivered from an internal micro-fission generator.|4|6|0|7|0|7
  - Grenade Launcher|Lethal grenades that bounce off surrounding structures and detonate on impact causing massive area damage.|8|2|8|2|1200|4
  - EMP Grenade Launcher|EMP grenades that bounce off surrounding structures and detonate on impact and temporarily stun enemies.|4|2|8|2|2500|30
  - Missile Launcher|Deadly homing missiles that deliver damage to far-away targets with precision.|5|7|4|5|2500|18
  - Flamethrower|Burning liquid at extreme temperatures sprayed at a high velocity from dual fuel tanks.|4|3|6|10|800|5
  - Minigun|Lethal armor-piercing rounds delivered with precision via high-speed gatling cycles.|6|7|0|8|4000|6
  - Railgun|High velocity armor-piercing rounds that delivers massive kinetic damage on impact.|9|10|0|2|5000|31
  - Laser Cannon|Fry your opponents in one hit with this ultra high-powered laser (hold mouse button to charge and fire).|10|10|0|1|6000|33
  - Grappling Hook|Hitch onto enemies with this armor penetrating hook system.|0|3|0|1|800|35
  - Shotgun|While accuracy might not be this gun's forte, its high amount of damage more than makes up for it.|8|2|9|6|6000|51
  cat2:
  - Liberator|A very powerful nuclear-based explosive that decimates everything within a large radius of the blast.|90|8|1500|8
  - UR-12 Concussion Mine|A standard mine with a high explosive power and large explosive radius.|55|7|1200|9
  - Incapacitator|This mine generates a large electromagnetic pulse that temporarily disables all cars in a wide radius around it.|30|10|850|10
  - EMP1|Standard EMP mine that temporarily disables any nearby units.|20|7|500|11
  - Mini Bar Mine|A small mine with a low explosive radius and medium damage.|35|3|300|12
  - Anti-Tank Bar Mine|A larger version of the Mini Bar Mine, this mine packs twice the damage with a medium range.|75|6|550|13
  - Proximity Mine|A large explosive mine that can detect the presence of nearby enemies.|65|6|1350|29
  - Temporary Shield Item|An over-shield that temporarily protects your car against damage.|50|0|3000|25
  - Temporary Boost|A boost that temporarily gives your car a burst of speed.|0|0|1500|36
  - Temporary Invincibility|Become invincible for a couple moments and escape your opponents during battle!|0|0|5000|40
  cat3:
  - Gold Plating Body Kit|Show your superiority over other players by plating your car in gold alloyed with tungsten.|0|1200|19
  - Platinum Plating Body Kit|Show your superiority over other players by plating your car in platinum alloyed with titanium.|0|1500|20
  - Carbon Fiber Body Kit|Racing junkies rejoice! This body kit will give your car a full carbon fiber makeover and reduce its overall weight.|0|4000|21
  - Crystal Body Kit|Show off your wealth by purchasing this crystal body kit. Makes your car semi-transparent and ultra shiny.|0|2000|22
  - Military Camouflage Body Kit|Give you car perceived stealth with this military-style camouflage body kit.|0|800|23
  - Rust-Bucket Body Kit|Turn your car into a flying, shooting, clunker of destruction!|0|500|24
  - Neon Glow Body Kit|Make your car glow a bright neon color.|0|1500|32
  - Aquatic Body Kit|Slice through the water with ease in this hydrophilic body kit.|0|2500|34
  - Melee Ramming Blade Kit|Cut down your opponents with a lethal plasma blade attached to the front of the car.|10|2500|26
  - Ghost Costume Body Kit|Get in the Halloween spirit (yes, I know I released it a bit late D:) with this cloth body kit!|0|1000|38
  - Christmas Gift Ribbon Green|Get in the Christmas spirit by decorating your car with this colorful green ribbon!|0|800|42
  - Christmas Gift Ribbon Red|Get in the Christmas spirit by decorating your car with this colorful red ribbon!|0|800|43
  - Rainbow Body Kit|Harness the power of rainbows with this awesome body kit. (Unable to display preview due to epicness).|0|10000|44
  - Rapid Fire Body Kit|Double the fire rate and halve the reload time at the expense of dealing half the damage.|0|2500|46
  - Off Road Body Kit|Drive over bumps with ease by tripling the suspension distance on your car.|0|4000|47
  - Glider Body Kit|Soar through the skies with ease using this deployable force-field glider wing. (Press [f] to open and close glider).|0|5500|48
  cat4:
  - Basic Armor|Basic armor for absorbing minimal damage from all types of weapon fire.|10|750|14
  - Light Armor|Light armor designed for speed rather than protection. Absorbs some damage from all types of weapon fire.|20|900|15
  - Assault Armor|Standard armor for combat units in battle. Frontal plates absorb most damage from all types of weapon fire.|45|1300|16
  - Heavy Armor|Titanium-tungsten alloy plates that cover all vulnerable areas of the car. Made for combat operations against large caliber weapons.|65|1700|17
  - Ninja Invisibility Armor|Hide in the shadows with this advanced armor that is both lightweight and protective. Remaining still while using this armor will render your car invisible.|35|4000|27
  - Ninja Regenerating Armor|Slowly regenerate your health with this advanced armor that is both lightweight and protective. Taking no damage for a period of time will start the health regen.|35|4500|28
  - Melee Slicer Armor|The big brother of the melee ramming blade kit; perfect for close-quarter combat. Cannot be equipped with the Sprinter Body Kit.|20|3000|39
  - Shock Armor|Absorb weapon impact and explosion force with this shock absorbing armor.|30|3000|41
  cat5:
  - Combat Car|While this car might not outperform the others, it is well balanced in speed, handling and acceleration.|5|5|5|5|0|49
  - Racer|Drive circles around your opponents with this rear-engine car's improved handling and acceleration.|4|8|7|5|15000|50
  - Sprinter|The lighter and faster chassis allows for a higher top speed and flying agility. Model created by GTR34.|7|5|3|8|15000|37
  - Devastator|High acceleration and top speed but reduced handling and flying agility make this muscle car best suited for ground combat. Model created by GTR34.|7|3|7|4|15000|52
