  greyTex: {fileID: 2800000, guid: fc868096749170549a81f572d004547b, type: 1}
  tutorialList:
  - "Howdy! It looks like you're new around here;\nthese messages should help you get up to speed!"
  - Use WASD or arrows to drive
  - "Hold space to fly/hover\n(double tap space to lock)"
  - "Hold shift to scope/aim\n(double tap shift to lock)"
  - Hold cmd/ctrl to brake
  - "Press e or 1 & 2 to switch between weapons\n(q cancels a weapon switch)"
  - Right click and drag to look around
  - "If you're lagging, reduce the quality\n(use the buttons above the chat)"
  - "Earn credits by beating opponents;\nUse your credits to buy epic items!"
  - That's it! Enjoy the game!
  spwnsrc: {fileID: 0}
  headless: {fileID: 0}
  lwindow: {fileID: 0}
  pex: {fileID: 0}
  eor: {fileID: 0}
  ach:
  - I am a Server
  - Whoosh!
  - Socializing
  - Team Planning
  - Server Power
  - Suicide
  - Accidents Happen
  - I am a Fish
  - To Infinity & Beyond
  - Boom!
  - Playing God
  - Six in a Row
  - Find the Railgun
  - Getting Rich Quick
  - Need For Speed
  - All Sold Out
  - Ol' One-Hundred
  - Two Hours
  achDesc:
  - Host a server
  - Drive off of a launch ramp
  - Say something in the lobby chat
  - Say something in the team chat
  - Evict a player in your server
  - Blow yourself up
  - Kill a person on your own team
  - Stay underwater for 1 minute
  - Fly to 1000 altitude
  - Blow up all the barrels in Chokepoint
  - Make a world in the Creator
  - Get a bot attack during a game
  - Find the railgun in Battle Island
  - Earn 350 credits in one round
  - Equip the Sprinter and temp. boost
  - Buy all items in the store
  - Go 100 mph
  - Play for two hours straight
  ddol: {fileID: 0}
